  "plot": "Eager to attend her sister April's wedding, commitment-shy tomboy and classic car enthusiast June Havens catches a plane to Boston. But sometimes, life is like a movie; out of nowhere, June encounters Roy Miller, a dashing stranger with a killer sense of humour. And just like that, June's life will never be the same again. After all, the unstoppable man of intrigue has plunged June into a thrilling world filled with high-speed car chases, intense hand-to-hand combat, and lethal stray bullets. As dangerous adversaries are hot on their trail, determined to retrieve a state-of-the-art device worth millions, pressing questions arise. Who is this Roy Miller guy? Is he truly one of the good guys? Above all, could he be \"The One\"?",
